Output docs/glyph-morphology-explorer.gif

Require python3

Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1600
Set Height 1000
Set Framerate 12
Set TypingSpeed 20ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Hide
Type "./run-browser.sh --block 'CJK Strokes'" Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "/31D6" Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show
# Turning stroke -> curved diagonal -> parallel stems -> hooked stems.
Sleep 2s
Type "/30CE" Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "/5DDD" Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "/FF98" Enter
Sleep 2s
Hide
Type "q"
Sleep 500ms
